<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens on dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens on dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened against both the dollar and the pound on Monday, commercial bank foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a commercial bank mean rate of 20.2995 against the dollar from 20.2765 last Friday. It traded at a mean rate of 31.6825 to the pound from 31.5830 last Friday.</p>
<p>--Nairobi Newsroom +254 2 330-261</p>
